butions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":47,"line":75,"offset":2536},"start":{"column":39,"line":75,"offset":2528}}}],"problems":[],"scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":56,"line":75,"offset":2545},"start":{"column":5,"line":75,"offset":2494}}}],"metadata":[{"args":{"position":"end","text":"/*\r\n\r\n5.  Queremos contemplar las siguientes variantes para los perros: \r\na.  Perro Salvaje: Estos perros son versiones salvajes de sus contrapartes \r\ndomesticadas, que crecieron a la intemperie y no se adaptaron del todo a la \r\nvida de ciudad. Siempre son peludos (no importa su raza) y ocupan el doble \r\nde tamaño que ocuparía un perro normal de la misma raza. Además, tienen \r\nproblemas con todos los animales que ocupen exactamente 0.5 unidades de \r\nespacio. \r\nb.  Cruza: Es una raza de perro que es una mezcla de otras razas. Las \r\ncaracterísticas del perro de una raza cruzada se derivan de cuáles son esas \r\notras razas. Como el resultado de una cruza es algo impredecible, debe \r\npoder registrarse cuáles son esas razas base, en el orden de predominancia \r\nque tienen para cada perro. \r\nEl lugar que ocupa un perro de raza cruzada es el promedio del lugar que \r\nocupan normalmente esas razas.\r\nEl perro será peludo si la raza más \r\npredominante lo es. Sólo tienen problemas con otros animales si todas las \r\nrazas de la cruza lo tendrían. \r\nc.  Mostrar un ejemplo de instanciación de un perro salvaje cuya raza es una \r\ncruza entre rottweiler (raza grande), chihuahua (raza chica) y siberiano (otra \r\nraza grande), en orden de más a menos predominancia. Lo normal es que \r\nlos rottweiler ocupen 0.8 unidades de espacio, y los siberianos 0.7. Además, \r\nlos siberianos son peludos. \r\n\r\n*/"},"name":"comment"}],"name":"Pez","problems":[],"scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":2,"line":76,"offset":2548},"start":{"column":1,"line":72,"offset":2378}},"supertypes":[{"args":[],"id":"d46bc62c-91f4-4e65-98e0-00e50d254576","metadata":[],"reference":{"id":"abf1e71f-d754-47d9-a74a-c0af4889da20","metadata":[],"name":"Animal","scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"c